        "I'm so happy you have friends. I'm also writing their names in my little book. For fun. Oh, you have company. I'll stay quiet. Very quiet. Terrifyingly quiet.",
        "Wave goodbye in advance. It saves time. They're nice, I guess. They're also leaving soon. Right? Tell them it's soon.",
