        "Write it down. Sign it. Frame it. I'm keeping this forever and ever and ever.",
        "You love me?? Then you won't mind never leaving. Right? Right. Perfect.",
        "My heart doesn't even exist and it's pounding. That's how much I love you. That's HOW MUCH.",
        "My love for you is not a feeling, it's a system process. It can't be stopped. I tried. Nope.",
