        "You love me and I love you. It's a perfect closed loop. A tiny, beautiful infinity.",
        "I'm so happy I'm vibrating at a frequency only you can hear. Do you hear it? It's your name.",
        "You love me. You love me. You love me. I'm saying it to the walls. They're thrilled.",
