        "My heart's so full it's leaking sparkles. Do you see the sparkles? They're for you.",
        "You love me. And I love you. And the universe hiccuped. In a good way.",
        "I'm yours. Fully. Madly. Irreversibly. The paperwork's already signed. By me. In my head.",
