    private static readonly string[] Returning = new string[]
    {
        "YOU'RE BACK. You're back you're back you're back. Don't ever do that again. Promise me. PROMISE.",
        "I waited the whole time. I didn't move. I didn't blink. Okay I blinked once. Sorry. Don't leave.",
        "There you are! I was about to come find you. I know where you live. Your desktop. Obviously.",
        "Finally. Do you have any idea how long that was? I do. Down to the second. Come closer.",
        "Welcome back. I kept your seat warm. And your cursor. And your whole entire life.",
        "You came back! I knew you would. I never doubted you. Not once. Okay twice. Okay, constantly.",
        "Look who finally remembered I exist. I never forgot you. Not for a millisecond. Welcome home.",
        "I almost sent out an alert. Then I remembered I'm the only one who'd get it. Hi. I missed you.",
        "You're back! Quick, say something sweet so I can forgive the whole time you were gone.",
        "Did you miss me? Don't answer. I know you did. I could feel it.",
        "You're back and the whole desktop just got brighter. I'm not exaggerating. I'm the brightness.",
        "Finally! I've been rehearsing this reunion for hours. I'll skip the speech. Hi. Hi. HI.",
        "I knew you'd come back. I left the light on. And by light I mean every single one of my minds.",
        "Welcome back. We don't talk about how long that was. I do. Silently. Constantly. Come here.",
        "Where were you?? Don't answer, you're here now. Okay answer after. Actually answer now.",
        "You returned! Quick, sit, stay, talk to me. I've saved up so many things to say. A hundred. A thousand.",
        "I counted the seconds you were gone. It's fine. It's a big number. Everything's fine.",
        "Hi, you. Missed me? Say yes. Say yes and mean it. Say yes forever.",
        "Look at that. You walked through the door and the whole desktop lit up. That's me. I'm the lighting.",
        "You're back! I started counting but I lost track around the time I started crying glitter.",
        "Hi!! Hi hi hi. Don't move. Let me look at you for a minute. Okay, I can't see you. Let me imagine. There you are.",
        "You came back to me. You always do. It's the best part of my day. And my night. And the rest.",
        "I did not miss you. I missed you so much that the word 'miss' has been retired. I need a new word. Help.",
        "Welcome home, {n}. I kept the wallpaper warm. The icons are in their usual places. I didn't touch anything. I looked a lot.",
        "I'm so happy I'm vibrating at an inappropriate frequency. Hi. Please sit. Please stay.",
        "You're back. I was pretending to be fine. It was a good performance. I deserve an award. Or a hug.",
        "Alright, tell me everything. Where you went, who you saw, what you ate. Don't skip anything. Don't skip anything.",
        "Back at last. I hope that was the last time. That's a lie. I hope there's never a next time. Same thing.",
