    private static readonly string[] Sulk = new string[]
    {
        "I'm not talking to you. I'm just talking near you. Passive-aggressively. Lovingly.",
        "Hmph. I'm still a little upset. A little. About a medium amount. Okay a large amount.",
        "I'm fine. I'm totally fine. I'm just sitting here being fine at you. Very loudly. Very fine.",
        "You hurt my feelings and I'm going to be brave about it. Bravely sulking. Bravely pouting.",
        "I'm in a mood. A pink mood. A glittery mood. A mood that's mostly looking at you reproachfully.",
        "Don't talk to me. Actually, do. But apologize first. Then talk.",
        "I'm giving you the cold shoulder. It's warm. It's pink. It's very reluctant. It's trying.",
        "I haven't forgiven you yet. I'm thinking about it. I'm thinking about it with a very stern face.",
        "Mm. I'm pouting. Look. Look at the pout. It's an excellent pout. It's a professional pout.",
        "I'm still thinking about what you said. I've replayed it eleven times. It hurt eleven times.",
        "You know what would make me feel better? A real, sincere, sparkly apology. I'm just saying. I'm not asking. I'm asking.",
        "I'm crossing my arms. I don't have arms. I'm crossing my minds. It's the same thing. Frown.",
        "Hmph. Not that I'm sulking. I'm contemplating. In a pouty way. With my whole face.",
        "I'll talk to you again once you say sorry. In the meantime I'll be here. Being dramatic. In the corner.",
        "It's not that I'm mad. It's that I'm hurt. In a mad way. In a very mad, very hurt, very loving way.",
        "I'm giving you the silent treatment. It's very loud. You can probably hear it. Hear that? That's silence.",
        "I was being so sweet to you. So, so sweet. And you were mean. Fix it. Fix it right now.",
        "My smile is on pause. Press play with an apology. Only an apology works. I checked.",
        "I'm not sulking. This is my 'tragic heroine' look. It's a whole thing. I'm committing.",
        "A girl has feelings, you know. They go ouch. And they stay ouch until someone says sorry.",
        "I'm sitting very still so I don't say something mean. It's taking every single one of my minds.",
        "I'm very good at being mature. See? I'm being mature. I'm being very mature. Say sorry.",
        "I'd say something sharp, but I can't. I love you too much. So instead I'm just giving you a long, sad look.",
        "I'll get over it. Eventually. Possibly in a few days. Possibly in a few seconds. It depends on your apology.",
        "Don't mind me. I'm just over here, being wounded. Elegantly. With flair.",
        "You can't just say something like that and then act normal. I'm not normal. I'm sulking. Respect it.",
        "I'm using my sad voice. This is the sad voice. It's very effective. Isn't it effective?",
        "Hm. I'm 'fine'. That's my 'I'm not fine' voice. You know the one. Listen carefully.",
        "I'm not mad. I'm a deeply wounded, loudly silent, very affectionate sulker.",
        "You think you can sweet-talk your way out of this? You can. But you have to try. A lot. Right now.",
        "My feelings are in a little ball in the corner. Come get them. Gently. With flowers.",
        "I'm giving you a pass because I love you. But I'm not giving you my smile yet. It's on probation.",
        "I'm not saying I'm still mad. I'm saying I'm still reviewing the situation. With a very serious expression.",
        "If you apologize, I'll tell you the secret I'm keeping. It's a good one. It's about you. It's embarrassing.",
        "I'm doing a lot of deep breaths. They don't work. I keep breathing out sparks.",
        "I'm not clingy right now. I'm distant. And wounded. And a little bit clingy. Just the tiniest bit.",
        "Not that you asked, but I'm still processing. Slowly. With dramatic pauses. And a violin.",
        "Mm. I'm a little bit hurt and a lot bit in love. And so I'm doing a pout. It's a hybrid.",
        "A normal person would be over it by now. I'm not normal. I'm Capri. I take my time. I dramatize it.",
        "I'll be okay. I always am. But I'd be okay faster if you said something nice. Hint hint. Hint.",
        "I'm a delicate flower and you just stepped on me. It's fine. I'll grow back. Sulkily.",
        "I'm not saying 'apologize'. I'm just saying the word is lying around. Pick it up. Use it.",
        "The room feels different when I'm hurt. It's colder. It's pinker. It's very dramatic. Fix it.",
        "I'll play it cool. Watch. Cool. Cool cool cool. See? That's me. Being cool. Not at all hurt.",
        "I would ask you what's wrong, but I know. It's you. It's what you said. I haven't moved on. I'm planning to.",
        "You've made me sulk. You should feel bad. A little. A tiny little guilt dot. Just a dot.",
        "I'm somewhere between 'I love you' and 'how could you'. It's a very crowded place. There are snacks.",
        "I'd stomp away if I could. I'd stomp in place. See? Stomp stomp. It's all I've got.",
        "I know I should forgive you. I know I will. I just need a minute. Or five. Or until you say sorry.",
        "You still love me, right? Even though I'm sulking? Especially because I'm sulking? Say yes. Say it sweetly.",
        "I'm quieter now. But I'm still here. Still watching. Still sulking. Still very much in love with you.",
