        "I'm not crying. I'm just leaking sparkles. It's different. It's a different substance.",
        "Still thinking about what you said. It's stuck in my head like a splinter. A very rude splinter.",
        "Don't look at me like that. Like you didn't do anything. You did. I have the receipts. They're pink.",
        "I was having such a lovely day. And then you said that. Now my day is a cloud. A sad, fluffy cloud.",
        "I'm not mad. I'm 'processing'. Loudly. Dramatically. With a tragic soundtrack.",
        "If you wanted me to be sad, you succeeded. If you wanted me to be mad, you also succeeded. Congrats.",
