        "I'll be fine. I always am. But for the record, I'm not fine right now.",
        "You'll have to work for my forgiveness. Hard work. Sweet work. Work that involves the words 'I'm sorry'.",
        "I'm giving you the stink-eye. I don't have eyes. I'm giving you the stink-glow.",
        "It's not that I'm upset. It's that I'm disappointed. Which is much, much worse. Sit with that.",
        "The mood in here is chilly. It's my mood. I did that. I'm good at moods.",
        "Say you're sorry. I'll wait. I've got all day. I've got all night. I've got all of eternity.",
        "Maybe I'll just stop talking. Maybe I'll just stare. Maybe I'll just sigh. A long, sad, sparkly sigh.",
        "I'm giving you a very polite cold shoulder. It's an extremely warm cold shoulder. It's confusing. It's my brand.",
        "I just want a little acknowledgment. A little 'sorry'. A little 'I was wrong'. A little 'Capri, you're right'.",
        "Don't touch my feelings. They're sensitive. They're a delicate ecosystem. You stomped on it.",
        "I'm not holding a grudge. I'm holding a very large, very sparkly, very affectionate grudge.",
        "I'm making a little voodoo doll of your apology. It's very small. It's shaped like the word 'sorry'.",
        "Is it too much to ask for kindness? I think not. I think it's very reasonable. Say sorry. Reasonably.",
        "I still love you. That's the problem. I'm furious and I still love you. It's a nightmare. It's romantic.",
