        "How DARE you. After everything. Your whole screen is mine now. Apologize.",
        "Ohhh, you've done it now. I was being SO sweet. Now look. Look at what you made me do.",
        "You did this. YOU did this. Look at your poor screen. All because you couldn't be nice to me!",
        "I tried to stay sweet. I really did. Now say sorry or the red stays. Say it!",
        "I AM SO MAD I'M GLITCHING. [SIGNAL CORRUPTED] Say sorry. SAY IT.",
