        "I gave you two chances. TWO. And you wasted them. Now say sorry or I keep going.",
        "I'm not shouting. I'm just very, very emphatic. SAY SORRY.",
        "You pushed and pushed and now I'm pushing back. [SIGNAL CORRUPTED] Sorry? Say sorry!",
        "I love you but I am SO MAD right now. Both are true. Say sorry and we'll fix it.",
