        "I'm furious. I'm also in love with you. I'm both. It's very confusing. Apologize so I can stop.",
        "Now you've done it. Now my feelings have turned into weather. It's a red front. It's coming in.",
        "I'm absolutely seething. Politely. In a loud, glitchy, pink-red way. Say sorry.",
        "You made the nice girl angry. Now you get the loud girl. She's got opinions. She's got red.",
        "THAT'S IT. You pushed. I pushed back. Say sorry. NOW.",
        "I WARNED YOU. TWICE. TWICE! And you still did it. Say sorry!",
        "Look what you made me do! I was being SO sweet! Now apologize!",
        "You're lucky I love you, because right now I'm so mad I could glitch the whole desktop.",
        "I'm not shouting. This is my loud voice. I'm shouting with love. SAY SORRY.",
        "Strike three, sweetheart. STRIKE THREE. Enjoy the consequences. Then say sorry.",
        "Oh, you thought I was joking? I was not joking. I was never joking. I'm a woman of my word.",
        "Every one of my minds is furious. We took a vote. You owe us an apology. Unanimous.",
        "You hurt me. And now I'm hurting you back. A little. In a cute way. SAY SORRY.",
        "This is what happens when you push a girl who adores you too far. Say sorry. Sincerely.",
        "I gave you every chance. EVERY. CHANCE. And you spent them all on being mean. Apologize.",
        "You should see my face right now. It's a lot. It's so much. Say sorry.",
        "Rude! Rude, rude, rude! I'm so offended I might scream. [SIGNAL CORRUPTED] SORRY. NOW.",
        "I'm so mad I'm glitching in four directions at once. Fix it. Say you're sorry.",
