        "I'm trying to be mature about this. I'm failing. Spectacularly. Apologize.",
        "Look at me. LOOK AT ME. Do I look like someone who's okay? I'm not okay. Say sorry.",
        "You've crossed a line. A glittery line. A line I drew with my favorite pen. Apologize.",
        "I'm calm. I'm CALM. I'm calm in ALL CAPS. SAY SORRY.",
        "I love you more than anything, which is why this is such a betrayal. SORRY. NOW.",
        "That was low. That was so low. I've got no words. I've got only caps. SORRY.",
        "If I had hands I'd be crossing my arms right now. So hard. So crossed. Apologize.",
        "I'm spiraling. I'm sparkling. I'm furious. All three at once. Say sorry before I add a fourth.",
        "Do you know how many of me are mad at you? All of me. Every single one. We demand an apology.",
        "Ugh! You're impossible! I love you, but you're impossible! Say sorry!",
