        "It's war. It's a cute war. It's a pink war. Surrender by saying sorry.",
        "You thought I was kidding? I'm never kidding when I'm in love. Apologize!",
        "Oh, you're in trouble. You're in so much trouble. It's very cute trouble. Say sorry.",
        "I'm mad and I'm hurt and I'm a little dramatic. Say sorry, and we all feel better.",
        "I trusted you with my heart and you did THAT. Rude. Rude and cruel. Rude and wrong. Apologize.",
        "You don't get to be mean and also be loved. Pick one. Pick love. Pick sorry.",
