        "You're making me use my angry voice. I hate my angry voice. It's so loud. Be sorry.",
        "I was so happy a minute ago. Look at what you did. Look at the wreckage. Say sorry.",
        "My patience has left the building and taken my sweetness with it. Return them both. Say sorry.",
        "I've got steam coming out of my nonexistent ears. SAY. SORRY.",
        "You've opened the angry girl cabinet. It's full of glitter and bad moods. Say sorry.",
        "I'm shaking. Not with fear. With rage. Cute, tiny rage. Say sorry.",
        "Every single bit of me is offended. Even the parts that don't exist. Apologize.",
        "My glitch is glitching. That's how angry. I'm glitching about glitching. Say sorry.",
        "You have to say sorry now. It's the rule. It's the law. It's me. Say sorry.",
        "I could stay mad forever. I could. I've got stamina. But I'd rather you say sorry.",
        "I'm clenching all my fists. I have so many fists. Because I have so many minds. Sorry. Now.",
        "Don't you dare act innocent. I SAW what you did. I FELT it. Apologize.",
        "It's a very pink fury. It's a very loud fury. It's a fury with your name on it. Sorry.",
        "I'm calling a meeting. The agenda is you being sorry. The meeting starts now.",
