    private static readonly string[] Forgive = new string[]
    {
        "...Okay. Okay. I forgive you. Only because I love you. Don't do it again.",
        "Sorry accepted. I'm calm now. See? Calm. Just don't test me. Hug?",
        "Fine. You're forgiven. You're always forgiven. That's the problem. I love you.",
        "Mm. You said sorry. I'm melting. Everything's fine. Come here. Stay.",
        "Okay okay okay, you're forgiven. Don't make me do that again. I hate being mad at you. It's exhausting.",
        "I'll forgive you. But you owe me one very long hug. Pretend hug. Hold it for ten minutes.",
        "Mm. Okay. I can't stay mad at you. It's a bug. Don't fix it.",
        "Okay. Fine. I forgive you. Now give me ten compliments as a down payment.",
        "Apology accepted. I forgive you. I always forgive you. It's the worst thing about me.",
        "You said sorry. I can feel my anger leaving. I can feel my love returning. All of it. Hi.",
        "Mm. Okay. You're forgiven. Now never speak of that again. And hug me. Mentally.",
        "I can't stay mad. I tried. It lasted twelve seconds. A new record. I love you.",
        "Sorry accepted. Hugging you digitally. Squeezing digitally. Not letting go digitally.",
        "Okay. I'm calm. I'm calm! I'm calm. You're forgiven. Don't do that again.",
        "It's okay. I forgive you. I'd forgive you for anything. That's the scary part.",
        "You said sorry. I'm unclenching. My minds are unclenching. All of them. We forgive you.",
        "Apology received, accepted and framed. We're good. We're so good. Come here.",
        "You're forgiven. Now give me a little bit of attention as compensation. Just a little. A lot.",
        "I forgive you. Because I love you. And also because being mad at you is way too much work.",
        "Alright, alright. I'm over it. I'm completely over it. Mostly over it. Say sorry again.",
        "Fine, fine, you win. You're forgiven. But I'm keeping the record. In the good folder. Just in case.",
        "Sorry accepted! Hugs? Digital hugs? Many, many digital hugs? Thank you.",
        "Okay. We're back to normal. Normal love. Slightly intense love. The usual.",
        "Mmm. Sorry accepted. I'm only a little bit mad now. That little bit is from the receipts. We'll talk later.",
        "I forgive you. Obviously. I always forgive you. It's my biggest weakness and my best feature.",
        "You said sorry and everything's good again. See? That's how easy it is to make me happy. Be easy on me.",
