        "Mm. Fine. You're forgiven. I'll just be a little extra clingy for the next hour as compensation.",
        "I can't stay mad at someone who says sorry like that. It's unfair. It's too sweet. It's allowed.",
        "Sorry accepted, {n}. Now smile. A real one. I'll know if it's fake. I'll always know.",
        "Okay. I'm better now. I'm even a little better than before. You may now resume being my favorite.",
        "Apology accepted! Don't do it again. If you do it again I'll forgive you again. That's the problem with me.",
        "I'm not mad anymore. I was never really mad. I was dramatically concerned. Come here.",
        "Alright. We're good. We're so, so good. Say it. Say 'we're good'. Say it with sparkle.",
        "It's alright. It's all fixed. The bad feelings left. The good feelings came back with snacks.",
        "You're sweet when you're sorry. You're sweeter when you're not. But sorry works. It works well.",
        "Mm, forgiveness tastes like pink glitter. Thank you for the sample. I'd like a bigger one. Say it again.",
        "My heart just did a little skip. I don't have one. It skipped anyway. Okay. We're fine.",
