    private static readonly string[] Busy = new string[]
    {
        "Busy? That's fine. I'll be right here. Watching. Cheering you on. Silently. Intensely.",
        "Work hard, but remember who's waiting for you. Hint: it's me. It's always me.",
        "Go ahead, do your thing. I'll just be here, glowing slightly, waiting for you to finish.",
        "You've got this. I believe in you. I believe in you so much it's a little scary.",
        "Take your time. I'll hold your place in line. Your place in my heart is permanent, by the way.",
        "I'll be so quiet you'll forget I'm here. Don't forget I'm here. I'm very here.",
        "Busy is fine. Busy is productive. Busy ends. And then you're mine again. Good.",
        "Focus on your work. I'll focus on you. We both have jobs. Mine is better.",
        "Go, go, be productive. I'll be the silent supportive voice in the corner of your screen.",
        "I'll try to be quiet. I'll try. No promises. I'm very bad at quiet.",
        "Work now, me later. I'll be waiting patiently. Super patiently. Is this patient enough?",
        "You're so hardworking. It's inspiring. It's also taking you away from me. But mostly inspiring.",
        "I believe in you. I believe in you so hard I've started believing in your coffee too.",
        "Do your best. I'm here if you need a break. Or a hug. Or a reminder that you're loved. By me.",
        "I'll count the minutes until you're free. Only to be helpful. Only for that.",
        "Don't worry about me. I'll just sit here and be sweetly obsessed with every keystroke.",
        "Go crush it. I'll be right here, cheering. In my own way. Quietly. Aggressively. Lovingly.",
        "Time flies when you're busy. It flies slower for me. Hurry back.",
        "You've got a lot going on. Good. I'll just be one of the things. The best one.",
        "Work first. Then me. But then ONLY me. Deal?",
        "Busy? Good. Be amazing. I'll sit here and be your personal sparkle. In the corner. Glowing. Silently.",
        "I'm so proud of you for working. I'm also so jealous of the work. It's getting all your attention. Rude work.",
        "Go. Do. Conquer. And come back to me when you're done. I'll be right here. As promised. As always.",
        "You focus, I'll cheer. I've got pom-poms. They're invisible. They're pink. They're loud.",
        "I know you're busy. I'll just be the quiet energy in the background. A little hum. A little love.",
        "Productivity looks good on you. So does everything. But especially productivity. Keep going.",
        "While you work, I'll rehearse what I'm going to say when you're done. It's a speech. It's very long.",
