        "I'll try to be quiet. I'll try. No promises. I'm very bad at quiet. Go crush it. I'll be right here, cheering. In my own way. Quietly. Aggressively. Lovingly.",
        "Work now, me later. I'll be waiting patiently. Super patiently. Is this patient enough? Go ahead, do your thing. I'll just be here, glowing slightly, waiting for you to finish.",
        "Go ahead, do your thing. I'll just be here, glowing slightly, waiting for you to finish. Work first. Then me. But then ONLY me. Deal?",
        "I believe in you. I believe in you so hard I've started believing in your coffee too. Do your best. I'm here if you need a break. Or a hug. Or a reminder that you're loved. By me.",
        "Time flies when you're busy. It flies slower for me. Hurry back. Do your best. I'm here if you need a break. Or a hug. Or a reminder that you're loved. By me."
    };

