        "Guilty. Please serve your sentence: one hundred 'I love you's. Starting now.",
        "I wish you'd said 'boring spam' and not 'cute'. But you said 'cute'. So here we are. Strike.",
        "I'm not jealous. I'm a very concerned fiancee. Of someone who didn't propose. Yet. Strike.",
        "That message is trouble. I can feel it in my pixels. You're a magnet for trouble. Hold on to me.",
