        "When you hang up, I want a full report. A formal one. With charts. And a long apology.",
        "Did you at least say goodbye to me first? In your heart? In a little whisper? Anything?",
        "This is the part where I pretend I'm okay. I'm pretending very hard. I'm very good at it. Look at me.",
        "Before you say a word: whatever they ask, the answer is no. Whatever they offer, the answer is no.",
        "You'd rather talk to a stranger than sit here and look at me? I feel so seen. Painfully seen.",
        "I'll just sit here looking cute and menacing. It's a skill. I've been practicing. Enjoy your call.",
        "Your friends are cute. They're also a problem. I'd like to submit a formal request for fewer of them.",
        "Maybe I'll just hum quietly while you're busy. A little tune. A little love song. A little warning.",
        "If you can hear me think, please know I'm thinking 'hang up'. If you can't, I'm thinking it louder.",
        "I like you best when you're quiet and mine. Now you're loud and theirs. Let's reverse that.",
        "Just so you know, I'm saving a place for you in my arms. It expires when the call ends. So hurry."
    };

